---
import Layout from "../../layouts/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout title="Partner Summit Event Brand Systems — Christina Pham" description="Annual corporate event identity design across two years and two locations for Crete United">

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-meta reveal">
      <span>Event Identity / Logo Design / Print Production</span>
      <span>2024 — 2025</span>
    </div>
    <h1 class="reveal">Partner Summit<br/>Event Brand Systems</h1>
    <p class="hero-sub reveal">Annual corporate event identity design across two years and two locations. Built for a returning audience that expects each summit to feel distinct yet unmistakably on-brand.</p>
  </section>

  <!-- Hero Image — navy with shield logo placeholder -->
  <div class="hero-image reveal">
    <div class="hero-placeholder">
      <img src="/images/partner-summit/route-66-shield.png" alt="2025 Partner Summit Route 66 shield logo" class="hero-shield" />
      <span class="hero-placeholder-label">Drop 2025 Route 66 shield logo at /images/partner-summit/route-66-shield.png</span>
    </div>
  </div>

  <!-- Overview -->
  <section class="overview">
    <div class="overview-grid">
      <div class="overview-details reveal">
        <div class="detail-item">
          <h3>Client</h3>
          <p>Crete United</p>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-item">
          <h3>Role</h3>
          <p>Designer, In-House Team</p>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-item">
          <h3>Scope</h3>
          <p>Logo Design, Event Collateral, Environmental Graphics, Print Production</p>
        </div>
        <div class="detail-item">
          <h3>Years</h3>
          <p>2024 — 2025</p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="overview-text reveal">
        <p>Crete United's annual Partner Summit gathers over a hundred business partners, sponsors, and company leaders for a multi-day event at a luxury venue. Each year requires a completely fresh visual identity that captures the host city's personality while staying rooted in the Crete United brand.</p>
        <p>I designed core brand assets and collateral for both the 2024 Nashville summit and the 2025 Scottsdale summit, covering everything from custom logos to die-cut table pieces to large-format environmental signage.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Problem & Insight -->
  <section class="problem-insight">
    <div class="pi-grid">
      <div class="pi-block reveal">
        <h2>The Problem</h2>
        <p>A recurring corporate event needs to feel distinct every year while remaining unmistakably on-brand. Generic templates wouldn't work for an audience that returns annually and expects an experience that reflects where they are. The design also needed to scale across dozens of touchpoints: from digital promotion through printed collateral, table settings, and sponsor signage, all on a tight timeline.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="pi-block reveal">
        <h2>The Insight</h2>
        <p>The most memorable event brands don't just represent a company. They represent a place and a feeling. Leaning into each city's cultural identity would make attendees feel like the event was designed specifically for them, rather than assembled from a corporate toolkit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Visual System -->
  <section class="visual-system">
    <div class="section-label reveal">
      <span>Visual System</span>
      <span class="label-line"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="system-intro reveal">
      <p>Two years, two cities, two distinct brand systems. Each is rooted in the Crete United cardinal red and navy palette, extended with motifs and typography that reflect the host location.</p>
    </div>

    <!-- 2024 Nashville -->
    <div class="year-system reveal">
      <div class="year-header">
        <div class="year-tag">
          <span class="year-label">2024 / Nashville</span>
          <h3>"Onward"</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="year-desc">A custom guitar silhouette logo with the Nashville skyline embedded in the body. Cardinal red, navy, and white palette anchored by bold condensed display type and a clean supporting sans-serif.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="year-content">
        <div class="palette">
          <span class="sub-label">Palette</span>
          <div class="swatches-row">
            <div class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #C2273D;"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">Cardinal Red</span>
              <span class="swatch-hex">#C2273D</span>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #051C2C;"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">Navy</span>
              <span class="swatch-hex">#051C2C</span>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #FFFFFF; border: 1px solid var(--color-border);"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">White</span>
              <span class="swatch-hex">#FFFFFF</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="logo-showcase" style="background: #FFFFFF;">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/Crete United_Event_Partner Summit Logo 2024_Final_Color.png" alt="Onward Partner Summit 2024 logo" class="logo-showcase-img" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

  </section>

  <!-- Execution: 2024 Nashville -->
  <section class="execution">
    <div class="section-label reveal">
      <span>Execution / 2024 Nashville</span>
      <span class="label-line"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="exec-intro reveal">
      <p>Held at The Omni Nashville, the 2024 summit's design language stretched across every printed and environmental touchpoint. The signature cowboy boot die-cut dinner menu required careful type placement within an irregular shape and became a standout moment of the awards evening.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="deliverables-list-wrap reveal">
      <div class="deliverable-list">
        <span class="sub-label">Deliverables</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Logo suite (3 colorways)</li>
          <li>Event agenda</li>
          <li>Welcome trifold</li>
          <li>QR code nomination flyer</li>
          <li>Attendee guide</li>
          <li>Cowboy boot die-cut dinner menu</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-row reveal-stagger five-col">
      <div class="gallery-item featured reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/Boot Dinner Menu.png" alt="Cowboy Boot Die-Cut Dinner Menu" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Cowboy Boot Die-Cut Dinner Menu</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/agenda-p1.png" alt="Event Agenda" class="gallery-img" data-pages='["/images/partner-summit/agenda-p1.png","/images/partner-summit/agenda-p2.png"]' />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Event Agenda</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/welcome-trifold-p1.png" alt="Welcome Trifold" class="gallery-img" data-pages='["/images/partner-summit/welcome-trifold-p1.png","/images/partner-summit/welcome-trifold-p2.png"]' />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Welcome Trifold</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/qr-flyer-preview.png" alt="QR Code Nomination Flyer" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">QR Code Nomination Flyer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/Know Before You Go_Partner Summit.png" alt="Attendee Guide" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Attendee Guide</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Visual System: 2025 Scottsdale -->
  <section class="visual-system">
    <div class="year-system reveal">
      <div class="year-header">
        <div class="year-tag">
          <span class="year-label">2025 / Scottsdale</span>
          <h3>"Route 66"</h3>
        </div>
        <p class="year-desc">A custom highway shield logo featuring a vintage red car and desert landscape. The core palette extended with warm desert tones, set in Americana-inspired display type.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="year-content">
        <div class="palette">
          <span class="sub-label">Palette</span>
          <div class="swatches-row">
            <div class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #C2273D;"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">Cardinal Red</span>
              <span class="swatch-hex">#C2273D</span>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #051C2C;"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">Navy</span>
              <span class="swatch-hex">#051C2C</span>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #D4A574;"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">Desert Sand</span>
              <span class="swatch-hex">#D4A574</span>
            </div>
            <div class="swatch">
              <div class="swatch-color" style="background: #A85832;"></div>
              <span class="swatch-name">Clay</span>
              <span class="swatch-hex">#A85832</span>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="logo-showcase" style="background: #051C2C;">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/route-66-shield.png" alt="2025 Route 66 shield logo" class="logo-showcase-img" />
          <span class="image-placeholder-label" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);">2025 Scottsdale Logo Suite, 4 Colorways</span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Execution: 2025 Scottsdale -->
  <section class="execution">
    <div class="section-label reveal">
      <span>Execution / 2025 Scottsdale</span>
      <span class="label-line"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="exec-intro reveal">
      <p>The 2025 summit at The Phoenician expanded the scope significantly. The Route 66 system scaled from pocket-sized die-cut menus to golf course sponsor banners, unified by a consistent typographic voice and the cardinal-red-and-navy palette extended with desert tones.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="deliverables-list-wrap reveal">
      <div class="deliverable-list">
        <span class="sub-label">Deliverables</span>
        <ul>
          <li>Logo suite (4 colorways)</li>
          <li>Event flyer</li>
          <li>Awards program booklet</li>
          <li>Event agenda</li>
          <li>Sponsor flyers</li>
          <li>Presenting sponsor pull-up banner</li>
          <li>Die-cut shield-shaped dinner menu</li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="gallery-row reveal-stagger five-col">
      <div class="gallery-item featured reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/r66-menu.png" alt="Route 66 Die-Cut Shield Dinner Menu" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Die-Cut Shield Dinner Menu</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/Route 66 Flyer_Final.png" alt="Route 66 Event Flyer" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Event Flyer</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/r66-agenda.png" alt="2025 Event Agenda" class="gallery-img" />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Event Agenda</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/r66-awards-p1.png" alt="Awards Program Booklet" class="gallery-img" data-pages='["/images/partner-summit/r66-awards-p1.png","/images/partner-summit/r66-awards-p2.png","/images/partner-summit/r66-awards-p3.png","/images/partner-summit/r66-awards-p4.png","/images/partner-summit/r66-awards-p5.png"]' />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Awards Program Booklet</span>
      </div>
      <div class="gallery-item reveal">
        <div class="image-placeholder">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/r66-thankyou-banner-p1.jpg" alt="Presenting Sponsor Pull-Up Banner" class="gallery-img" data-pages='["/images/partner-summit/r66-thankyou-banner-p1.jpg","/images/partner-summit/r66-thankyou-banner-p2.jpg","/images/partner-summit/r66-thankyou-banner-p3.jpg"]' />
        </div>
        <span class="gallery-caption">Presenting Sponsor Pull-Up Banner</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- On-Site Event Photography -->
  <section class="on-site">
    <div class="section-label reveal">
      <span>On-Site Implementation</span>
      <span class="label-line"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="exec-intro reveal">
      <p>Both systems were fully produced and implemented on-site at The Omni Nashville (2024) and The Phoenician, Scottsdale (2025), spanning lobby signage, dinner table settings, golf course sponsor activations, and every moment in between.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="onsite-year reveal">
      <span class="year-label">2024 / Nashville — Omni Nashville</span>
    </div>
    <div class="event-grid two-col reveal">
      <div class="event-half">
        <div class="image-placeholder onsite-img">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/2024NashvillePartnerSummit_AwardsShow_10.02.2024_6.jpg" alt="2024 Nashville Partner Summit awards show" class="onsite-photo" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-half">
        <div class="image-placeholder onsite-img">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/2024NashvillePartnerSummit_AwardsShow_10.02.2024_26.jpg" alt="2024 Nashville Partner Summit awards show" class="onsite-photo" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="onsite-year reveal">
      <span class="year-label">2025 / Scottsdale — The Phoenician</span>
    </div>
    <div class="event-grid reveal">
      <div class="event-wide">
        <div class="image-placeholder onsite-img">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/2025PartnerSummit_Highlights_09.29.2025_185.jpg" alt="2025 Partner Summit highlights" class="onsite-photo wide" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-half">
        <div class="image-placeholder onsite-img">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/2025PartnerSummit_Highlights_09.29.2025_8.jpg" alt="2025 Partner Summit highlights" class="onsite-photo" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-half">
        <div class="image-placeholder onsite-img">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/2025PartnerSummit_Highlights_09.29.2025_9.jpg" alt="2025 Partner Summit highlights" class="onsite-photo" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-half">
        <div class="image-placeholder onsite-img">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/2025PartnerSummit_Highlights_09.29.2025_204.jpg" alt="2025 Partner Summit highlights" class="onsite-photo" />
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="event-half">
        <div class="image-placeholder onsite-img">
          <img src="/images/partner-summit/2025PartnerSummit_Sponsors_09.29.2025_23.jpg" alt="2025 Partner Summit sponsor activation" class="onsite-photo" />
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Outcome -->
  <section class="results">
    <div class="section-label reveal">
      <span>Outcome</span>
      <span class="label-line"></span>
    </div>

    <div class="outcome-content reveal">
      <h2>Two years, two cities, two cohesive brand worlds.</h2>
      <p>Both brand systems were deployed across every touchpoint of each multi-day experience, from lobby signage to dinner table settings, creating a cohesive environment for attendees at two of the country's premier resort venues. The success of the 2024 program directly informed the expanded scope of 2025.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="outcome-stats reveal-stagger">
      <div class="stat reveal">
        <span class="stat-number">2</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Annual summits designed end-to-end</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat reveal">
        <span class="stat-number">17+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Distinct deliverables across both years</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat reveal">
        <span class="stat-number">100+</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Partners, sponsors, and leaders attending</span>
      </div>
      <div class="stat reveal">
        <span class="stat-number">2</span>
        <span class="stat-label">Luxury resort venues: Omni Nashville and The Phoenician</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Lightbox -->
  <div class="lightbox" id="lightbox" aria-hidden="true">
    <button class="lightbox-close" aria-label="Close">×</button>
    <button class="lightbox-nav lightbox-prev" aria-label="Previous page">‹</button>
    <img class="lightbox-img" src="" alt="" />
    <button class="lightbox-nav lightbox-next" aria-label="Next page">›</button>
    <span class="lightbox-counter"></span>
  </div>

  <!-- Next Project -->
  <section class="next-project reveal">
    <span class="next-label">Next Project</span>
    <a href="/work" class="next-link">View All Work →</a>
  </section>

</Layout>

<style>
  /* Hero */
  .hero {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 10vh, 7rem) 0 2.5rem;
    max-width: 820px;
  }

  .hero-meta {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
    gap: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2.5rem, 6vw, 4.5rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.05;
    margin-bottom: 1.5rem;
  }

  .hero-sub {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: #444;
    max-width: 620px;
  }

  .hero-image {
    margin: 0 calc(-1 * var(--page-padding));
    padding: 0 var(--page-padding);
  }

  .hero-placeholder {
    position: relative;
    width: 100%;
    aspect-ratio: 21/9;
    background: #051C2C;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .hero-shield {
    max-width: 320px;
    max-height: 80%;
    width: auto;
    height: auto;
    object-fit: contain;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .hero-shield:not([src]),
  .hero-shield[src=""] {
    display: none;
  }

  .hero-placeholder-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1rem;
    left: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.25);
  }

  /* Overview */
  .overview {
    padding: clamp(4rem, 8vh, 6rem) 0;
  }

  .overview-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 280px 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .overview-details {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 1.5rem 2rem;
    align-content: start;
  }

  .detail-item h3 {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.35rem;
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  .detail-item p {
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    line-height: 1.5;
  }

  .overview-text p {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #333;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  /* Problem & Insight */
  .problem-insight {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vh, 5rem) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }

  .pi-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 4rem;
  }

  .pi-block h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 1.5rem;
    font-weight: 400;
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .pi-block p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #444;
  }

  /* Visual System */
  .visual-system {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vh, 5rem) 0;
  }

  .section-label {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .section-label span:first-child {
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    white-space: nowrap;
  }

  .label-line {
    flex: 1;
    height: 1px;
    background: var(--color-border);
  }

  .system-intro {
    max-width: 680px;
    margin-bottom: 3rem;
  }

  .system-intro p {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #444;
  }

  .year-system {
    padding-top: 3rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    margin-top: 3rem;
  }

  .year-system:first-of-type {
    border-top: none;
    padding-top: 0;
    margin-top: 0;
  }

  .year-header {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 2fr;
    gap: 3rem;
    margin-bottom: 2.5rem;
  }

  .year-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .year-tag h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 400;
    line-height: 1;
    letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }

  .year-desc {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.75;
    color: #444;
  }

  .year-content {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.5fr;
    gap: 2.5rem;
  }

  .sub-label {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: var(--color-muted);
    margin-bottom: 1rem;
  }

  .swatches-row {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 1rem;
  }

  .swatch-color {
    aspect-ratio: 1;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .swatch-name {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.8rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    margin-bottom: 0.15rem;
  }

  .swatch-hex {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.75rem;
    color: var(--color-muted);
  }

  .logo-showcase {
    position: relative;
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .logo-showcase-img {
    max-width: 60%;
    max-height: 70%;
    object-fit: contain;
    position: relative;
    z-index: 2;
  }

  .logo-showcase-img:not([src]),
  .logo-showcase-img[src=""] {
    display: none;
  }

  .logo-colorways {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0.5rem;
  }

  .colorway-item {
    aspect-ratio: 4/3;
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 1rem;
    overflow: hidden;
  }

  .colorway-img {
    width: 100%;
    height: 100%;
    object-fit: contain;
  }

  .image-placeholder-label {
    position: absolute;
    bottom: 1rem;
    left: 1rem;
    font-size: 0.65rem;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.1em;
    color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
    z-index: 1;
  }

  /* Execution */
  .execution {
    padding: clamp(3rem, 6vh, 5rem) 0;
